# The shared HUD bar panels: the spots they can sit at, the settings page that moves them, and the
# /zighud command family. The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as
# ziggfreedcommon.hud.<key>. The desc.* keys are what the engine's own help resolves a command or
# an argument through.

